---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Luxury Vinyl Plank (LVP) Flooring Renovation Hub | CalcForDIY"
  description="Step-by-step DIY project workflow for installing luxury vinyl plank flooring: subfloor preparation, moisture barriers, click-lock plank layout, and baseboard shoe molding."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "HowTo",
    "name": "Luxury Vinyl Plank (LVP) Flooring Installation Workflow",
    "description": "A comprehensive 4-phase DIY workflow for transforming any room with luxury vinyl plank flooring, from subfloor leveling to shoe molding finishing.",
    "step": [
      {
        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "position": 1,
        "name": "Subfloor Flatness Inspection & Plywood Repair",
        "url": "https://calcfordiy.com/calculators/subfloor",
        "text": "Inspect subfloor flatness within 3/16 inch over 10 feet. Replace damaged OSB/plywood sheets and secure loose boards to eliminate squeaks."
      },
      {
        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "position": 2,
        "name": "Vapor Barrier Underlayment & Sound Padding",
        "url": "https://calcfordiy.com/calculators/underlayment",
        "text": "Lay 6-mil polyethylene vapor barrier over concrete slabs or acoustic underlayment over wood subfloors with taped seams."
      },
      {
        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "position": 3,
        "name": "Luxury Vinyl Plank (LVP) Layout & Stagger",
        "url": "https://calcfordiy.com/calculators/vinyl-plank-flooring",
        "text": "Calculate box counts with 10% waste, maintain 1/4-inch perimeter expansion gaps, and stagger plank end joints by at least 8 inches."
      },
      {
        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "position": 4,
        "name": "Baseboard & Shoe Molding Installation",
        "url": "https://calcfordiy.com/calculators/baseboard-shoe-molding",
        "text": "Install baseboards and base shoe molding nailed into the wall studs (never the floating floor) to cover the perimeter expansion gap."
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>

  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://calcfordiy.com" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Projects", "item": "https://calcfordiy.com/projects" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "LVP Flooring Renovation Hub", "item": "https://calcfordiy.com/projects/lvp-flooring-renovation" }
    ]
  }
  </script>

  <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4 print:hidden">
    <a href="/" class="hover:text-blue-600">Home</a>
    <span>/</span>
    <a href="/projects" class="hover:text-blue-600">Projects</a>
    <span>/</span>
    <span>LVP Flooring Renovation Hub</span>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-8">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-full text-amber-800 text-xs font-semibold mb-3">
      <span>🪵 Complete Flooring Renovation Workflow</span>
      <span>•</span>
      <span>4 Interactive Calculators</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">
      Luxury Vinyl Plank (LVP) Flooring Renovation Hub
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
      Follow this 4-step project workflow to plan, measure, and install durable click-lock Luxury Vinyl Plank flooring with flawless transitions and trim.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Step-by-Step Construction Cards -->
  <div class="space-y-6 mb-12">
    <!-- Step 1 -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-xs hover:border-blue-300 transition-all">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-xl w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shrink-0">
          1
        </div>
        <div class="grow">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1 mb-2">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Subfloor Preparation &amp; Flatness Inspection</h2>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 rounded-full">Phase 1: Foundation</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Floating LVP requires a flat substrate (tolerance: 3/16" over 10 feet). Inspect existing plywood or concrete, screw down squeaky joist bays, and replace moisture-damaged subfloor sheets.
          </p>
          <a href="/calculators/subfloor" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 hover:bg-blue-100 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg transition-colors">
            <span>Open Subfloor Plywood Calculator →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2 -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-xs hover:border-blue-300 transition-all">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-xl w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shrink-0">
          2
        </div>
        <div class="grow">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1 mb-2">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Moisture Barrier &amp; Acoustic Underlayment</h2>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 rounded-full">Phase 2: Moisture Protection</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            On concrete basement and ground-level slabs, install a 6-mil polyethylene vapor barrier roll with 8-inch taped overlaps to prevent moisture seepage into the locking joints.
          </p>
          <a href="/calculators/underlayment" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 hover:bg-amber-100 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg transition-colors">
            <span>Open Floor Underlayment Calculator →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 3 -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-xs hover:border-blue-300 transition-all">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-xl w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shrink-0">
          3
        </div>
        <div class="grow">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1 mb-2">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Plank Layout, Box Takeoff &amp; Stagger</h2>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 rounded-full">Phase 3: Flooring Installation</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Calculate exact box counts based on carton square footage, stagger end joints by at least 8 inches, maintain 1/4-inch wall expansion gaps, and calculate doorway transition T-moldings.
          </p>
          <a href="/calculators/vinyl-plank-flooring" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-100 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg transition-colors">
            <span>Open Luxury Vinyl Plank Calculator →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 4 -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-xs hover:border-blue-300 transition-all">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-xl w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shrink-0">
          4
        </div>
        <div class="grow">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1 mb-2">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Baseboard &amp; Shoe Molding Finishing</h2>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full">Phase 4: Trim &amp; Detail</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Conceal the 1/4" perimeter expansion gap with baseboard and quarter round/shoe molding. Fasten nails directly into wall studs at a 45° angle, keeping the floating floor free to expand.
          </p>
          <a href="/calculators/baseboard-shoe-molding" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 hover:bg-purple-100 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg transition-colors">
            <span>Open Baseboard &amp; Shoe Molding Calculator →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Related Guide Card -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-blue-950 text-white rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2 text-blue-200">Recommended Reading</h3>
    <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm mb-4">Learn how carton packaging, room angles, and waste factors impact your flooring budget:</p>
    <a href="/guides/how-many-boxes-of-vinyl-plank-flooring" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg text-xs transition-colors">
      Read Guide: How Many Boxes of Vinyl Plank Flooring Do I Need? →
    </a>
  </div>

</Layout>
